@startuml
[*] --> Arrived : Arrival of user
Arrived --> Card inserted : Card insertion event
Card inserted --> PIN checked : Card insertion event
alt Correct PIN
PIN checked --> User has chosen an option : Correct PIN condition
else Incorrect PIN or invalid card
PIN checked --> Invalid card or too many incorrect PIN attempts : Incorrect PIN or invalid card condition
end
User has chosen an option --> Processing request : User choice event
Processing request --> [*] : User cancels operation
Invalid card or too many incorrect PIN attempts --> [*] : System keeps card for security
@enduml
